---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /pages/blog/index.html
title: Blog — Security & Facility Management Insights
description: Industry insights, buyer guides and best practice for security services, armed guarding, hotel security and facility management across North Bengal and India.
hero:
  title: Security & facility management blog
  subtitle: Practical guides for facility managers, procurement teams and small-business owners deciding on security and manpower.
breadcrumbs:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Blog", url: "/pages/blog/" }
---

<section>
  {%- if collections.blog.length > 0 -%}
  <ul class="post-list">
    {%- for post in collections.blog -%}
    <li class="post-list-item">
      <p class="text-muted">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
      <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      {% if post.data.subtitle %}<p>{{ post.data.subtitle }}</p>{% endif %}
      <p><a class="text-link" href="{{ post.url }}">Read more →</a></p>
    </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
  {%- else -%}
  <p>Posts coming soon.</p>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>
